# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: A Taste of Flame (4023).
# A Taste of Flame (4022) instead for the group that did Velarok's chain to Trinkets... (3481) in 40-50/06: the hoard it
# gives holds the Black Dragonflight Molt, so Cyrus takes it at once with no drake to fight.
# Petty Squabbles (2783) and A Tale of Sorrow (2801), 5,100 XP: Ardalan in Nethergarde Keep, where the flight lands,
# and the Fallen Hero just over the Swamp of Sorrows border, on the Blasted Lands stop before the hearth.
# Sunken Temple (`when dungeon "Sunken Temple"`, dungeons in the route): for a character who took Brohann
# Caskbelly's Into The Temple of Atal'Hakkar (1475) in forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands, the run follows
# the Fallen Hero, at about 52 (its Group Finder minimum is 50): the temple's door is in the Pool of Tears, east of
# him. Brohann takes the tablets on the Stormwind stop of forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus (`when complete`).
# The Essence of Eranikus (3373) starts with a drop inside and ends at the Essence Font inside (the run's tip names
# it). The every-quest route (`when dungeon "Sunken Temple" all`) adds the Atal'ai Exile's Jammal'an the Prophet (1446,
# taken in forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands, back to him at the start of 50-60/04-western-plaguelands) and,
# for a runner holding 3373's Chained Essence of Eranikus, its second part (3374) at Itharius, between the temple
# and the Blasted Lands.
# The every-quest route also takes, in the run: Marvon Rivetseeker's Into the Depths and Secret of the Circle (3446,
# 3447, from 40-50/07-un-goro-crater; both answered inside), Gregan Brewspewer's Haze of Evil (4143, back to Muigin on
# 50-60/04's Marshal's Refuge stop), and the class quests for Morphaz: Xylem's Destroy Morphaz (8253, Mage) and
# Ogtinc's Blood of Morphaz (8257, Priest) as their chains end here, a Hunter's chain at Ogtinc (8151, 8153, 8231 to
# The Green Drake, 8232) and a Rogue's at Xylem (8234, 8235 to The Azure Key, 8236), each taken in Azshara before the
# run.
# City of Dalaran (`when dungeon "City of Dalaran" all`): Arille Azuregaze's Silvermoon Shimmerwine from the blood elves
# at Kim'jael's camp, and A Taste of Home (96609) and Thicker Than Water (96812) handed in at Dalaran's edge on the ride
# from Southshore to Chillwind Camp.
# Left out: Dark Iron Legacy (3801). Yeh'kinya's The God Hakkar (3528) and its The Ancient Egg (4787): the egg lies
# among the Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guards (level 50 elites) and Hitah'ya the Keeper (51) at the Hinterlands' southern
# edge, where the route is at about 47.5, before the run; the route's danger rule holds such a goal until 49. The
# Druid's A Better Ingredient (9053): its Toxic Test stabs a Devilsaur (level 54 elite), held until 52, and the route
# is in Un'Goro at about 50 before the run.

