step The Sunken Temple
  when dungeon "Sunken Temple"
  when onquest 1475,1446,3446,3447,4143,8253,8257,8232,8236
  when level>=50
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip The Sunken Temple is a dungeon for a group of five, levels 50 to 60. Its door is in the sunken temple in the eastern lake, the Pool of Tears, east of the Fallen Hero: keep clear of Stonard on the way.
  tip Inside: the Atal'ai Tablets for Brohann Caskbelly. The Essence of Eranikus, a drop inside, starts a quest of its own. Unless you chose only the quests on your way: Marvon's two quests end at the Altar of Hakkar and the Idol of Hakkar, the oozes and lurkers drop Gregan's Atal'ai Haze, and Morphaz, the drake after Jammal'an, carries a Mage's, Priest's, Hunter's or Rogue's class quest item.
  enter "Sunken Temple" @69.9,53.5
